            "review_title": "Review at Capricciosa Pasta & Pizza",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n19\nNice Italian style pizza and pasta meals\nSep 2024 • Solo\nI popped in here for a quick lunch today after seeing a movie. Service was super quick and friendly. I just ordered an iced fruit tea and a spicy beef and mushroom pizza and both went well together. I actually found the pizza pretty good. \n\nThe Menu seems to have grown larger since my last visit about a year ago when I was living upstairs in Landmark 81, then I use to pop in regularly. There seems to be a wider variety of dishes available now. Still a good option when you want a break from shopping or somewhere to drop into after a movie.\nRead more\nWritten September 27, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
