            "review_title": "Review at Capricciosa Pasta & Pizza",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n42\nItalian @ Landmark 81\nNov 2023 • Couples\nI had eaten lunch here before alone and thought it was ok, this time my dinner date suggested eating Italian after seeing a movie at CGV only two minutes walk away.\n\nThe service was friendly as usual and we were sat down quickly. We decided to order a half/half pizza to share followed by two pastas and a bottle of wine. \n\nSurprisingly we were told we could not order our own half/half combination, that it had to be exactly one from the menu. First time either of us had experienced this, but said ok and we chose one accordingly from the menu. We then selected our pastas. From the wine list i chose a wine which i was told was not in stock, I chose a second wine also not in stock, so I asked what was in stock and chose one of those.\n\nThe food arrived as we requested: wine and pizza first followed by our pastas. The food itself was delicious. The pastas are definitely the stronger dishes. Which is odd considering they have massive pizza ovens. I think they just need to be more flexible in allowing customers to choose which pizzas they would like half/half of and be a little more generous with the toppings and they will get 5 stars. The wine was actually delicious. For us the highlight and what saved the meal was the pastas and the wine.\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2023",
