            "review_title": "Review at Capricciosa Pasta & Pizza",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n16\nItalian Pasta & Pizza at Landmark 81\nOct 2023 • Solo\nI have eaten here twice while staying at Landmark 81 and both times i thought the servings were small in size and the toppings on the pizza could have been more generous. Aside from this the taste is actually very good, i just wish there was more of it.\n\nOn a more positive note the staff are always very helpful, polite & friendly and the service is quite good. If something is going to take a little time to prepare they tell you in advance which is excellent. I wish more places were this transparent.\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2023",
