            "review_title": "Review at Capricciosa Pasta & Pizza",
            "review_text": "Daphnekuo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam406 contributions\n2\n熱鬧的義大利餐廳\nOct 2019\nThis Italian restaurant is located on the first floor of the 81-mark Landmark, a new building in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. We ate at noon on Sunday. We didn't have any reservation but we were quickly seated because the seats in the restaurant were plenty. In order to judge whether the meal is authentic, we ordered Cheese Pizza and Pasta white sauce. The taste and quantity are quite good, they serve dishes were also very fast. The dining environment is open, so you can see the crowds around you when you dine. \n\n這家義大利餐廳位於越南胡志明市新標的建築-81 Landmark的地下1樓, 我們星期日中午去用餐, 沒有訂位也不用排隊, 很快就被安排入座, 因為餐廳內的座位設置還算多. 為了評斷餐點是否道地, 我們點了Cheese Pizza以及培根白醬Pasta, 口味及分量相當不錯, 上菜速度也很快, 用餐環境開放, 所以用餐時還可以看到周遭逛街的人潮, 適合喜歡熱鬧的饕客.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 29, 2019",
